guide butler-routes-completionist/stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale - Completionist
levels 30-45
zone Stranglethorn Vale
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

# The Vale is done in two passes: the northern jungle first (Rebel
# Camp, Nesingwary's camp, the Kurzen compound, the west-north), then
# Booty Bay and the cape, with expedition legs for the chains that
# leave the zone. Krazek and Kebok stand in Booty Bay in the data, not
# at the Rebel Camp - their errands belong to the second pass.

step The Duskwood road - Rebel Camp arrival

  accept 215 only Alliance @38,3.4 -- Jungle Secrets - Private Thorsen; Doren takes it at the camp
  accept 203 only Alliance -- The Second Rebellion - Sergeant Yohwa; Kurzen Jungle Fighters, the compound
  accept 204 only Alliance -- Bad Medicine - Sergeant Yohwa; remedies and fern extract, the compound
  accept 210 only Alliance -- Krazek's Cookery - Corporal Kaleb; carry the crock pot to Krazek in Booty Bay, south
  note Thorsen walks two points ([38,3.4] + [40.34,8.44]) - this step uses his camp point.
  accept 93443 only Alliance -- Lost Shipping Crate - the crate on the north shore; Friz takes it in Riverglades, late
  note 93443's twins (94841/94895/94930) are the Desolace and Thousand Needles versions of the same crate - ours is the Vale's.

step Rebel Camp - secrets and the camp records

  turnin 215 only Alliance -- Jungle Secrets - Thorsen's word to Lieutenant Doren
  accept 200 only Alliance -- Bookie Herod - Lieutenant Doren; his records, the compound
  turnin 200 only Alliance -- Bookie Herod - back to Bookie Herod's Records
  accept 328 only Alliance -- The Hidden Key - the records; the strongbox, east
  turnin 328 only Alliance -- The Hidden Key - the records' word to Bookie Herod's Strongbox
  accept 329 only Alliance -- The Spy Revealed! - the strongbox; the muddy note, Doren takes it
  turnin 329 only Alliance -- The Spy Revealed! - the strongbox's word to Lieutenant Doren
  accept 330 only Alliance -- Patrol Schedules - Lieutenant Doren; Sethman takes it
  turnin 330 only Alliance -- Patrol Schedules - Doren's word to Corporal Sethman
  accept 331 only Alliance -- Report to Doren - Corporal Sethman; carry it back
  turnin 331 only Alliance -- Report to Doren - Sethman's word to Lieutenant Doren

step The Kurzen compound - Yohwa's war

  complete 203 only Alliance @43.57,9.73 era -- Kurzen Jungle Fighters for Sergeant Yohwa
  complete 204 only Alliance @43.7,9.53 era -- Jungle Remedies off the Kurzen Medicine Men for Sergeant Yohwa
  complete 204 only Alliance @44.1,9.54 era -- Venom Fern Extract off the Kurzen supplies for Sergeant Yohwa
  turnin 203 only Alliance -- The Second Rebellion - back to Sergeant Yohwa
  turnin 204 only Alliance -- Bad Medicine - back to Sergeant Yohwa
  note 207's pres (203 and 204 above) fill here - take 207 after them.
  accept 207 only Alliance -- Kurzen's Mystery - Brother Nimetz; the four troll legends, west
  note 574's pres (203 and 204 above) fill here - take 574 after them.
  accept 574 only Alliance -- Special Forces - Sergeant Yohwa; commandos and headshrinkers, Doren takes it
  complete 574 only Alliance @44.15,7.91 era -- Kurzen Commandos for Sergeant Yohwa
  complete 574 only Alliance @46.33,6.96 era -- Kurzen Headshrinkers for Sergeant Yohwa
  turnin 574 only Alliance -- Special Forces - Yohwa's word to Lieutenant Doren
  note 202's pre (574 above) fills here - take 202 after it.
  accept 202 only Alliance -- Colonel Kurzen - Lieutenant Doren; elites, subchiefs and the Colonel's head
  complete 202 only Alliance @46.69,6.21 era -- Kurzen Elites for Lieutenant Doren
  complete 202 only Alliance @48.71,5.37 era -- Kurzen Subchiefs for Lieutenant Doren
  complete 202 only Alliance @49.94,3.95 era -- Colonel Kurzen's head for Lieutenant Doren
  turnin 202 only Alliance -- Colonel Kurzen - back to Lieutenant Doren
  accept 97047 -- The Cook in the Cage - Wendel Mathers, east; the cage key and a uniform
  complete 97047 @46.69,6.21 era -- the Compound Cage Key off the Colonel's guard for Wendel Mathers
  complete 97047 @49.6,7.7 era -- a Kurzen Fighter's Uniform from the supply crate for Wendel Mathers
  turnin 97047 -- The Cook in the Cage - back to Wendel Mathers
  note 97047's pre (79235, On the Lam, accepts in Desolace) lives outside this tracker's list.
  accept 97048 -- Returning to Port - Wendel Mathers; Aransas takes it in Booty Bay, south

step Nesingwary's camp - the welcome

  accept 583 -- Welcome to the Jungle - Barnil Stonepot; Hemet takes it
  turnin 583 -- Welcome to the Jungle - Barnil's word to Hemet Nesingwary
  note 185's, 190's and 194's pre (583 above) fills here - take the mastery lines after it.
  accept 338 -- The Green Hills of Stranglethorn - Barnil Stonepot; the four chapters, pages off the western trolls
  accept 339 -- Chapter I - Barnil Stonepot; pages 1, 4, 6 and 8, west
  accept 340 -- Chapter II - Barnil Stonepot; pages 10, 11, 14 and 16, west
  accept 341 -- Chapter III - Barnil Stonepot; pages 18, 20, 21 and 24, west
  accept 342 -- Chapter IV - Barnil Stonepot; pages 25, 26 and 27, west
  accept 79731 only Priest -- The Troll Scroll - the scroll; Hemet takes it
  note 79731's starter (the Deciphered Troll Scroll) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 79731 only Priest -- The Troll Scroll - the scroll's word to Hemet Nesingwary
  note 78823 names no starter in the data - the drawing (off Badlands Dustbelchers, expedition leg below) starts it; take it there.

