step The west-north - Zimmix and the tablets

  accept 97329 -- Where's the Key? - Zimmix Sputterspark; a primitive key off the western trolls
  accept 97328 -- Anything of Value - the thoroughly scavenged supplies; stolen shipments, Lozgil takes them
  note 97328's shipments name no placed source besides the supplies - work them off the supplies.
  complete 97328 @31.5,12.85 era -- Stolen Shipments from the scavenged supplies for Wharfmaster Lozgil
  complete 207 only Alliance @22.95,12.02 era -- the First Troll Legend off the Fall of Gurubashi tablet for Brother Nimetz
  complete 207 only Alliance @24.7,8.93 era -- the Fourth Troll Legend off the Emperor's Tomb tablet for Brother Nimetz
  complete 207 only Alliance @29.48,19.14 era -- the Second Troll Legend off the Moon Over the Vale tablet for Brother Nimetz
  complete 207 only Alliance @24.82,23.03 era -- the Third Troll Legend off the Gri'lek tablet for Brother Nimetz
  turnin 207 only Alliance -- Kurzen's Mystery - back to Brother Nimetz
  note 205's pre (207 above) fills here - take 205 after it.
  accept 205 only Alliance -- Troll Witchery - Brother Nimetz; skullsplitter fetishes, east, carried
  note 205's fetishes wait for the Skullsplitter detour below - carry it.

step The Skullsplitter detour - Nimetz's fetishes

  note East of the compound the Skullsplitters gather - take Nimetz's fetishes off their mystics, then head back north.
  complete 205 only Alliance @41.93,36.28 era -- Skullsplitter Fetishes off the Skullsplitter Mystics for Brother Nimetz

step The south road - to Booty Bay

  turnin 205 only Alliance -- Troll Witchery - the fetishes to Brother Nimetz
  note 206's pre (205 above) fills here - take 206 after it.
  accept 206 only Alliance -- Mai'Zoth - Brother Nimetz; the Mind's Eye off Mai'Zoth, east, carried
  note 95786's pre (205 above) fills here - take 95786 after it.
  accept 95786 only Alliance -- An Acquaintance in Southshore - Brother Nimetz; Dibbs takes it in Hillsbrad, late
  note The road south passes the Skullsplitter grounds, but their errands (tusks, notes) wait for Booty Bay accepts below - carry on.
  turnin 97048 -- Returning to Port - Wendel's word to Captain Aransas
  turnin 210 only Alliance -- Krazek's Cookery - Kaleb's crock pot to Krazek
  note 627's pre (210 above) fills here - take 627 after it.
  accept 627 only Alliance -- Favor for Krazek - Krazek; lesser bloodstone ore, Arathi and Hinterlands, late

step Booty Bay - Krazek and Kebok

  accept 198 only Alliance -- Supplies to Private Thorsen - Krazek; carry them north, returned late
  accept 201 -- Investigate the Camp - Krazek; find the hunters' camp, completed north late
  accept 616 only Alliance -- The Haunted Isle - Krazek; Revilgaz takes it
  accept 1116 -- Dream Dust in the Swamp - Krazek; dream dust, Swamp of Sorrows, late
  note 1116's pre (1115, the Rumormonger, accepts in Thousand Needles) lives outside this tracker's list.
  accept 189 -- Bloodscalp Ears - Kebok; ears off the western trolls
  accept 213 -- Hostile Takeover - Kebok; tumbled crystals off the venture geologists
  accept 95789 -- Shady Saltseers - Krazek and Kebok; a voodoo-infused artifact
  note The Saltseer mobs name no spawn in the data - have the artifact in your bags.
  complete 95789 @26.95,77.21 era -- the Voodoo-Infused Artifact for Krazek; the Saltseers name no source in the data, so have it in your bags
  turnin 95789 -- Shady Saltseers - back to Krazek
  accept 95791 -- The Saltseer Captain - Krazek and Kebok; the captain and his coroners
  note The Saltseer mobs name no spawn in the data - have the kills in your bags.
  complete 95791 @26.95,77.21 era -- Captain Dreadrise and his coroners for Krazek; the Saltseers name no source in the data, so have them in your bags
  turnin 95791 -- The Saltseer Captain - back to Krazek
  accept 2864 -- Tran'rek - Krazek; carry it to Tran'rek in Tanaris, late

step Booty Bay - Crank and the venture

  accept 605 -- Singing Blue Shards - Crank Fizzlebub; crystal shards off the southern basilisks
  accept 621 -- Zanzil's Secret - Crank Fizzlebub; Zanzil's mixture off the southern trolls

step Booty Bay - MacKinley and Shaky

  accept 606 -- Scaring Shaky - "Sea Wolf" MacKinley; mistvale giblets off the southern gorillas
  accept 2872 -- Stoley's Debt - "Sea Wolf" MacKinley; carry it to Stoley in Tanaris, late

step Booty Bay - writ: gauntlets (Blacksmithing)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 27.78,77.07
  accept 94226 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Green Iron Gauntlets - "Sea Wolf" MacKinley; back to MacKinley, at 60
  note 94226's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94226 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Green Iron Gauntlets - back to "Sea Wolf" MacKinley

step Booty Bay - writ: remote (Engineering)

  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 27.6,77.48
  accept 94235 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Gnomish Universal Remote - Scooty; back to Scooty, at 60
  note 94235's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94235 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Gnomish Universal Remote - back to Scooty

step Booty Bay - writ: shoulders (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 28.13,74.42
  accept 94244 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Dark Leather Shoulders - Narkk; back to Narkk, at 60
  note 94244's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94244 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Dark Leather Shoulders - back to Narkk

step Booty Bay - Smotts and the chest

  accept 8551 -- The Captain's Chest - Captain Hecklebury Smotts; his chest off Gorlash, south
  note The legacy Smotts chain (614, 615, 618, 620) is the same story told twice - this guide routes the 855x telling; same points either way.

step Booty Bay - the Bloodsail

  accept 595 -- The Bloodsail Buccaneers - First Mate Crazz; the correspondence, west
  note 599's pre (597 below) fills here - take 599 after the correspondence.
  note 604's pre (599 below) fills here - take 604 after it.
  note 608's pre (604 below) fills here - take 608 after it.

