step The west dash - the correspondence

  note The Bloodsail chain hinges on this paper: grab it, run it home, and the rest of the chain opens.
  turnin 595 -- The Bloodsail Buccaneers - the word to the Bloodsail Correspondence
  accept 597 -- The Bloodsail Buccaneers - the correspondence; Crazz takes it
  complete 610 only Alliance @27.39,69.42 era -- Catelyn's Blade off "Pretty Boy" Duncan for Catelyn the Blade

